        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>#1: &nbsp;The space the token of Blazing Tornado occupies is one of the hazard spaces it generates. &nbsp;Radius will always include the origin.</p><p>#2: &nbsp;The attacks are made seperately. &nbsp;Each Hazard space triggering is a different attack, and each hazard attack is target specific, and not for the entire hex in which it is triggered.</p><p>That means that if a player passed through a hazard space occupied by another target only the moving target would be attacked.</p>",
