        "created_at": "2015-03-04T15:57:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So if Thug 1 and Thug 2 are both on the same turn and end in two seperate hazard spaces, each hazard space generates a separte roll for the target in that specific hex?&nbsp; I roll once for Thug 1 and roll a seperate attack for Thug 2.&nbsp; That is what I thought.&nbsp; Thanks for the clarification.</p>",
